\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God be with you till we meet again,
\par By His counsels guide, uphold you,
\par With His sheep secretly fold you:
\par God be with you till we meet again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. God be with you till we meet again,
\par 'Neath His wings protecting hide you,
\par Daily manna still provide you:
\par God be with you till we meet again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. God be with you till we meet again,
\par When life's perils thick confound you
\par Put His arms unfailing round you:
\par God be with you till we meet again.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. God be with you till we meet again,
\par Keep love's banner floating o'er you,
\par Smite death's threatening wave before you:
\par God be with you till we meet again!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

